style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="637" width="384" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note10" value="07  P1 → Q1 actual reference" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="689" width="584" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note11" value="08  원문 u2 + 현재 근거 / 필요한 추가 조회와 모델 호출" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="741" width="744" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note12" value="09  MeaningProposal: 상반기 답변 → Q1 / T1 (아직 미채택)" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="793" width="944" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note13" value="10  prepare_answer(K1, Q1 v7, input / permission revision)" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="845" width="1184" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note14" value="11  TaskWriteSet: Q1 v8 + K1 PENDING + 선택적 hold 해제" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="897" width="1024" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note15" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="951" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note16" value="12  A1: RequestWriteSet + TaskWriteSet / expected revisions 검사" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="949" width="1264" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note17" value="13  COMMITTED: R2 관계 + Q1 + K1 / 충돌이면 모두 미반영" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="1001" width="904" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note18" value="14  claim(K1): 현재 gate / Task / 권한 조건 검사" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1683.4285714285716" y="1053" width="824" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note19" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1107" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note20" value="15  A2: PENDING → DISPATCHING 조건부 CAS" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1683.4285714285716" y="1105" width="764" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note21" value="16  claim 성공 / 실패면 외부 send 없음" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2180.5714285714284" y="1157" width="604" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note22" value="17  send(K1, X1, Q1, answer=상반기) / transaction 밖" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2677.714285714286" y="1209" width="984" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note23" value="18  외부 receipt / 수신 확인된 K1 / 단순 socket 성공과 구별" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2677.714285714286" y="1261" width="924" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note24" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1315" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note25" value="19  I1: raw receipt / event inbox 내구 저장, 확인 응답은 저장 뒤" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2180.5714285714284" y="1313" width="1064" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note26" value="20  외부 사실 적용 요청 / 원본 event ID와 revision" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1683.4285714285716" y="1365" width="804" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note27" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1419" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note28" value="21  A3: EXTERNAL_ACCEPTED + 실행 관측 + 내구 반환 event" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1683.4285714285716" y="1417" width="964" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note29" value="22  확인된 외부 사실 / 내구 원본 참조" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="1469" width="504" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note30" value="23  현재성 검사 뒤 P2 게시 허용 / 확인된 사실만 구성" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="1521" width="704" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note31" value="24  release(P2, output epoch) → 현재 발화 상태 검사 뒤 실제 출력" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="192.0" y="1573" width="1044" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note32" value="25  actual receipt(P2, Text / audible range)" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="192.0" y="1625" width="904" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note33" value="▣" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=21;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="30" y="1679" width="45" height="30.45" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note34" value="26  A4: 실제 전달 범위와 UNKNOWN 경계를 내구 원장에 기록" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2180.5714285714284" y="1677" width="804" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note35" value="27  P2 actual reference 반환 / Request의 실제 제시 관계 갱신" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="689.1428571428571" y="1729" width="1004" height="29.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note36" value="확정 전 실패" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=27;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1821" width="213" height="39.15" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note37" value="A1 충돌: 관련 변경 모두 미반영, 현재 원본 재조회.&#10;A2 CAS 실패: 외부 send 없이 현재 gate / Task 확인." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="1868" width="1024" height="72.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note38" value="확정 뒤 응답 유실" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=27;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1370" y="1821" width="294" height="39.15" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note39" value="같은 K1로 공동 확정 결과 조회.&#10;새 업무 ID로 재실행하지 않음. inbox에서 미반영 사실 복구." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1370" y="1868" width="949" height="72.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note40" value="정정과 전송의 경합" style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=27;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2640" y="1821" width="294" height="39.15" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note41" value="hold가 CAS보다 먼저: K1 보류 후 새 K2로 교체.&#10;CAS가 먼저: 외부 효력을 조회하고 지원되는 정정 / 취소." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#233247;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="2640" y="1868" width="874" height="72.5" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note42" value="각 줄은 설명용 정상 실행 순서다. 입력 수신과 다른 Task는 계속된다. 모델 / 네트워크 / 실제 출력 대기는 local transaction 밖이다." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#596A7C;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2005" width="2174" height="36.25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note43" value="내부 접수 ACCEPTED ≠ 외부 EXTERNAL_ACCEPTED ≠ 사용자 실제 제시. 전송 timeout은 UNKNOWN이며 외부 확인 없이 새 start를 만들지 않는다." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#A65E2E;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2048" width="2499" height="36.25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note44" value="A: 관련 owner 변경만 공동 확정한다. 모델 / 외부 API / 물리 출력은 포함하지 않는다. 내부 비동기와 worker, 다른 Task의 처리를 계속 허용한다." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;fontSize=24;fontColor=#596A7C;fontStyle=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="2092" width="2256" height="34.8" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
